# Questrade & Live Trading Safety

This project can execute real-money trades via Questrade. Follow these guardrails:

## Before live trading

- Ensure `TRADING_ENABLED` is explicitly set and understood (default: False)
- Use `QUESTRADE_USE_PRACTICE=True` for paper trading when testing
- Verify thresholds and sizing in `config.py` / `.env` before enabling

## When modifying trading or Questrade code

- Run unit tests: `make test-unit`
- Prefer dry-run or practice mode when testing flows
- Prefer read-only operations (accounts, balances, positions) during development; avoid live order placement unless intentionally testing it
- Avoid hardcoding API keys or tokens; use env vars and `config.get_*`
- See `docs/questrade_integration.md` for setup details
